      "widgets_values": [
        "A maximalist, AI-generated LEGO fantasy where the central figure is a rainbow-themed LEGO warrior — her body built from multicolored translucent and opaque bricks, with glowing joints and chromatic gradient skin. She sits between two washing machines made of LEGO Creator sets — metallic silver panels, circular clear doors with rainbow-hued spin graphics, and control panels made of stickered tiles. Pose: seated with legs bent at 90 degrees, left foot flat, right foot slightly raised; arms resting on her thighs, hands gently holding a magazine made of layered LEGO plates with holographic ink illustrations. She wears white sunglasses made of frosted LEGO pieces with prism-lens effects. Her hair is a sculpted LEGO braid with embedded LED lights. Her sneakers are chunky LEGO boots with rainbow color blocks and rubber treads. Beside her: a blue LEGO basket (built from perforated bricks) holds fluffy cotton candy “clothes” rendered as soft, fuzzy LEGO elements. The soda can is a red LEGO cylinder with shimmering holographic label. Environment: walls lined with LEGO storage units holding glowing detergent bottles and floating LEGO stars. Mood: toy-scale wonder meets surreal AI magic — every brick glows with internal light, colors shift subtly, shadows are crisp yet dreamy, and the entire scene pulses with playful energy."
